<div><h3>Klaviyo or Shopify Email for newsletters?</h3><p>Start newsletters on Shopify Email while sends stay occasional and catalogs compact; Klaviyo pays when newsletters branching and reporting complexity arrives — forecast profile cost on newsletters list growth.</p></div>
<div><h3>Omnisend vs Klaviyo for newsletters?</h3><p>For newsletters, Omnisend ships email-first newsletters plus light SMS fastest for small teams; Klaviyo counters with deeper newsletters segmentation — pilot one genuine newsletters journey on each and weigh upkeep, not checklists.</p></div>
